{"seq":2,"slug":"zoxide-smart-navigation","title":"zoxide 智能跳转","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/modern-cli-ecosystem/navigation-and-search/zoxide-smart-navigation","wordCount":561,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"zoxide-智能跳转\">zoxide 智能跳转</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>zoxide 是 cd 命令的智能替代品，通过 frecency 算法（频率 + 时效性的加权组合）学习你的目录访问模式，让你用最少的按键跳转到最常访问的目录。安装配置后，<code>z proj</code> 就能跳转到 <code>/Users/you/code/my-project</code>——无需记忆完整路径。zoxide 由 Rust 编写，支持所有主流 Shell，数据库本地存储，启动开销几乎为零。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"frecency-算法\">frecency 算法</h3><p>zoxide 的核心是 frecency 评分系统，综合考虑访问频率和最近访问时间：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Directory Visit&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Update Database&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Calculate Score&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;frequency weight&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;recency weight&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;visit_count * base_weight&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;time_decay_factor&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; H[&quot;final_score = freq * recency&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Directory Visit\"] --&gt; B[\"Update Database\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Calculate Score\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"frequency weight\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"recency weight\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"visit_count * base_weight\"]\n    E --&gt; G[\"time_decay_factor\"]\n    F --&gt; H[\"final_score = freq * recency\"]\n    G --&gt; H</pre><p>评分规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每次访问目录时，该目录的分数增加</li>\n<li>时间衰减：最近 1 小时访问权重 4x，24 小时内 2x，7 天内 1x，更早 0.5x</li>\n<li>当数据库条目超过阈值（默认 9000）时，自动修剪低分条目</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"匹配策略\">匹配策略</h3><p>zoxide 的路径匹配使用多关键字路径分段匹配：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>匹配策略</th>\n<th>示例匹配</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>z foo</code></td>\n<td>路径末段包含 &quot;foo&quot;</td>\n<td><code>/home/user/foo-project</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>z foo bar</code></td>\n<td>路径包含 &quot;foo&quot; 且末段含 &quot;bar&quot;</td>\n<td><code>/home/user/foo/bar</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>z /foo</code></td>\n<td>路径以 &quot;/foo&quot; 开头</td>\n<td><code>/foo/...</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>z foo/</code></td>\n<td>路径以 &quot;foo/&quot; 结尾</td>\n<td><code>xxx/foo/</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"安装与-shell-集成\">安装与 Shell 集成</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装&#10;brew install zoxide        # macOS&#10;sudo apt install zoxide    # Ubuntu 22.04+&#10;cargo install zoxide       # 从源码&#10;&#10;# Shell 集成（添加到配置文件末尾）&#10;# Zsh (~/.zshrc)&#10;eval &quot;$(zoxide init zsh)&quot;&#10;&#10;# Bash (~/.bashrc)&#10;eval &quot;$(zoxide init bash)&quot;&#10;&#10;# Fish (~/.config/fish/config.fish)&#10;zoxide init fish | source&#10;&#10;# 自定义命令名（默认是 z 和 zi）&#10;eval &quot;$(zoxide init zsh --cmd cd)&quot;  # 直接替换 cd&#10;eval &quot;$(zoxide init zsh --cmd j)&quot;   # 使用 j 作为命令名\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zoxide</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # macOS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zoxide</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # Ubuntu 22.04+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zoxide</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 从源码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Shell 集成（添加到配置文件末尾）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Zsh (~/.zshrc)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">eval</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">zoxide</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init zsh)\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Bash (~/.bashrc)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">eval</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">zoxide</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init bash)\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Fish (~/.config/fish/config.fish)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">zoxide</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fish</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> source</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 自定义命令名（默认是 z 和 zi）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">eval</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">zoxide</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init zsh </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">--cmd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cd)\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 直接替换 cd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">eval</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">zoxide</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init zsh </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">--cmd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> j)\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 使用 j 作为命令名</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"基础使用\">基础使用</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 跳转到最匹配的目录&#10;z project                    # 跳转到得分最高的含 &quot;project&quot; 的路径&#10;z dev tool                   # 多关键字：路径含 &quot;dev&quot; 且末段含 &quot;tool&quot;&#10;z doc-hub                    # 精确匹配 slug&#10;&#10;# 交互模式（需要 fzf）&#10;zi                           # 列出所有记录的目录，fzf 模糊选择&#10;zi project                   # 预过滤 &quot;project&quot;，再 fzf 选择&#10;&#10;# 回退到上一个目录&#10;z -                          # 等价于 cd -&#10;&#10;# 查看数据库&#10;zoxide query                 # 列出所有记录的目录和分数&#10;zoxide query --list          # 只列出路径（不显示分数）&#10;zoxide query -s project      # 查看 &quot;project&quot; 的匹配和分数\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 跳转到最匹配的目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">z</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> project</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    # 跳转到得分最高的含 \"project\" 的路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">z</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tool</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                   # 多关键字：路径含 \"dev\" 且末段含 \"tool\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">z</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> doc-hub</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    # 精确匹配 slug</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 交互模式（需要 fzf）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">zi</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                           # 列出所有记录的目录，fzf 模糊选择</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">zi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> project</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                   # 预过滤 \"project\"，再 fzf 选择</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 回退到上一个目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">z</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                          # 等价于 cd -</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看数据库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">zoxide</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> query</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                 # 列出所有记录的目录和分数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">zoxide</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> query</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --list</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # 只列出路径（不显示分数）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">zoxide</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> query</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> project</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 查看 \"project\" 的匹配和分数</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"数据库管理\">数据库管理</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 手动添加目录（无需实际访问）&#10;zoxide add /path/to/important/dir&#10;zoxide add ~/code/new-project&#10;&#10;# 删除条目&#10;zoxide remove /path/to/deleted/dir&#10;&#10;# 批量清理（删除不存在的目录）&#10;zoxide query --list | while read -r dir; do&#10;  [ -d &quot;$dir&quot; ] || zoxide remove &quot;$dir&quot;&#10;done&#10;&#10;# 导入其他工具的数据&#10;# 从 autojump 导入&#10;zoxide import --from autojump /path/to/autojump/db&#10;&#10;# 从 z.sh 导入&#10;zoxide import --from z /path/to/z/data\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 手动添加目录（无需实际访问）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">zoxide</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /path/to/important/dir</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">zoxide</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/code/new-project</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 删除条目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">zoxide</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remove</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /path/to/deleted/dir</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 批量清理（删除不存在的目录）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">zoxide</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> query</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --list</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> while</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dir</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  [ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$dir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> zoxide</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remove</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$dir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">done</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 导入其他工具的数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 从 autojump 